#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "Khmer-first news theme. A fast classic theme for news sites: hero grid, video and colored category blocks, breaking-news ticker, infinite-scroll archives with a list/grid switch, and a clean article page with a Khmer word-break toggle. The Sbek Theme page (under Appearance) sets the logo, brand colors, 11 self-hosted Khmer fonts, homepage sections, contact details and social links. About 10 KB of CSS and 6 KB of JavaScript (gzipped), no jQuery; built with Tailwind CSS v4 and vanilla JS."
msgstr ""

